## 6. Service Examples in MaritimeIQ

### MaritimeDataService

**Purpose**: Core data service for fleet operations

```csharp
public class MaritimeDataService : IMaritimeDataService
{
    private readonly IReadOnlyList<Vessel> _fleet;

    public IReadOnlyList<Vessel> GetFleet()
    {
        return _fleet;
    }

    public Vessel? GetVessel(int vesselId)
    {
        return _fleet.FirstOrDefault(v => v.Id == vesselId);
    }

    public FleetStatusSummary GetFleetStatus()
    {
        return new FleetStatusSummary
        {
            TotalVessels = _fleet.Count,
            ActiveVessels = _fleet.Count(v => v.Status == VesselStatus.Active),
            // ... more status data
        };
    }
}
```

### PagerDutyService

**Purpose**: Integration with PagerDuty for incident management

```csharp
public class PagerDutyService : BaseMaritimeService, IPagerDutyService
{
    public override string ServiceName => "PagerDuty Service";

    public async Task<string> CreateIncidentAsync(IncidentRequest request)
    {
        return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
        {
            LogInformation("Creating PagerDuty incident", nameof(CreateIncidentAsync));
            
            // PagerDuty API integration
            var incident = await _pagerDutyClient.CreateIncidentAsync(request);
            
            return incident.Id;
        }, nameof(CreateIncidentAsync));
    }
}
```

### OnCallService

**Purpose**: On-call rotation and escalation management

```csharp
public class OnCallService : BaseMaritimeService, IOnCallService
{
    public override string ServiceName => "On-Call Service";

    public async Task<OnCallEngineer?> GetCurrentOnCallEngineerAsync(string role = "Primary")
    {
        return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
        {
            LogInformation("Getting current on-call engineer", nameof(GetCurrentOnCallEngineerAsync));
            
            // Business logic to determine on-call engineer
            var schedule = await GetCurrentScheduleAsync();
            return schedule?.Engineers.FirstOrDefault(e => e.Role == role);
        }, nameof(GetCurrentOnCallEngineerAsync));
    }
}
```

