## 8. Health Checks

### Service Health Monitoring

**Health Check Implementation**:

```csharp
public override async Task<bool> HealthCheckAsync()
{
    try
    {
        LogInformation("Performing health check", nameof(HealthCheckAsync));
        
        // Check service dependencies
        var isDatabaseHealthy = await _database.HealthCheckAsync();
        var isExternalApiHealthy = await _externalApi.HealthCheckAsync();
        
        return isDatabaseHealthy && isExternalApiHealthy;
    }
    catch (Exception ex)
    {
        LogError(ex, nameof(HealthCheckAsync));
        return false;
    }
}
```

**Benefits**:
- Service health monitoring
- Dependency health checks
- Integration with health check endpoints
- Proactive issue detection

