## 10. Service Testing

### Unit Testing Services

**Mocking Dependencies**:

```csharp
[Fact]
public async Task GetIntelligenceDashboardAsync_ReturnsDashboard()
{
    // Arrange
    var logger = new Mock<ILogger<MaritimeIntelligenceService>>();
    var service = new MaritimeIntelligenceService(logger.Object);

    // Act
    var result = await service.GetIntelligenceDashboardAsync();

    // Assert
    Assert.NotNull(result);
    Assert.NotEmpty(result.Widgets);
}
```

**Benefits**:
- Easy to test (mock dependencies)
- Fast execution
- Isolated testing
- Clear test structure

